<title>USA: Muni bond sales total $2.8 bln for week of March 3.</title>
<headline>Muni bond sales total $2.8 bln for week of March 3.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Municipal bond sales for this week are expected to total $2.8 billion in 73 sales, according to Reuters Municipal Bond Information Group.</p>
<p>Negotiated offerings total $2.1 billion in 33 sales, with a $300 million Jefferson County, Ala., issue through Raymond James topping the list.</p>
<p>On the competitive side, 40 sales totaling $746 million are on the schedule. A $450 million North Carolina deal on Wednesday is the largest.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
